rider level: Beginner-Intermediate
flex: 3.5/10 (1=soft, 10=stiff)
shape: Twin/Twin (symmetrical tip and tail, twin flex with perfectly symmetrical design tip to tail)
camber type: PurePop Camber (evolution of traditional camber with subtle flat zones outside feet for amplified pop and playful feel; early rise tip and tail reduce catch and enhance float)
width: Standard, Wide
mounting pattern: The Channel (channel system for front and rear inserts, fine-tune stance width, more freedom in stance location; compatible with most major binding brands, works best with Burton EST bindings)
available lengths: 152cm, 155cm, 157cm, 159cm, 162cm, 157cm Wide, 159cm Wide, 162cm Wide
pro rider association: Mark McMorris
laminate: Triax (fiberglass layered above and below core for versatile flex and consistent response)
core: Super Fly II 700G Core with Dualzone EGD and Squeezebox
core detail super fly II: Stronger and lighter woods targeted in specific areas for more pop and strength while reducing weight
core detail dualzone EGD: Wood grain aligned along heel and toe edge in two unbroken zones perpendicular to rest of core for consistent edge hold and strength
core detail squeezebox: Thicker more powerful sections combined with thinner more flexible sections profiled throughout core for enhanced energy transfer, snappier and more stable
edges: Frostbite Edges (edges extend slightly underneath bindings for enhanced edge hold on hardpack and ice)
base: Sintered (durable, highly porous base material for added strength and wax absorption for long lasting glide)
tip/tail construction: Pro-Tip (tip and tail taper out at the points, reducing swing weight and promoting mobility)
durability technology: Infinite Ride (boards overbuilt in factory then broken down by machinery for consistent performance from day one through multiple seasons)
resin: Super Sap Epoxy (bio-based resin that reduces carbon footprint by 50% over conventional petroleum-based epoxies)
graphic: Holographic helmet upgrade (re-release of popular 2024 graphic)
shipping restriction: Only available for shipping within Australia
